OL,3,GNEWSATeacher's blood cancer sparks
OL,4,Aschool donor hunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Adam Lee said: "We wanted
OL,7,Fto be there for her, but we didn't know
OL,8,Fhow. Now that she hasn't got a stem
OL,9,Fcell donor, we really feel rallied and
OL,10,Fthere's been an incredible response."
